@startuml sell-error-sell-more-than-owned
!include sell-style.puml
title <size:12><color:#087F8C>08 / ERROR PATH · 409</color></size>\nCheck inventory before changing it

actor Client #F3F7FA
participant "Application service" as S
participant "Portfolio" as P #E6F3F1
participant "Holding" as H #E6F3F1
participant "HTTP advice" as E #FFF5DF
note over S, H
  Separate error fixture: 10 AAPL shares owned.
  Portfolio and quote already retrieved.
end note
Client -> S : sell 100 AAPL via REST
S -> P : sell(AAPL, 100, price)
activate P
P -> H : sell(100, price)
activate H
H -> H : available 10 < requested 100
H --[#B64D4D]> P : ConflictQuantityException
deactivate H
P --[#B64D4D]> S : propagate exception
deactivate P
S --[#B64D4D]> E : propagates through Spring MVC
E --> Client : 409 · Conflict Quantity
note over P, H
  No lot reduction and no cash update.
  Neither portfolio nor sale record is saved.
end note
@enduml
